5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely that we are doing this together. I wonder if we should look into how our seating affects our conversations?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should be objective. I am interested in the staff survey and the badge records to see how things actually are.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think the budget is important. Maybe the floor billing and the facilities quote?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to know about the morning routine upstairs! And maybe those unplanned shuffles from last year?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll handle the physical side. Sound meter readings and the physio's note seem like the only rational choices.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
