30,2,1,talk,Shizue,,It seems that sitting close helps the new members learn and reduces the need for long notes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The badge records show we arrive at very different times. Also, daylight is a major complaint in the survey.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The billing is based on area, not people... and re-running power is quite expensive per desk.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh dear, the morning routine upstairs takes a lot of time, and past shuffles caused weeks of interruptions!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"As I suspected, the noise varies significantly across the room, and adjusting workstations takes days of effort.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, if the cost is high, perhaps we should choose a layout that we won't need to change often?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"If we use a first-come system, the early arrivals will always get the best spots, like the windows.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,Yes... the facilities quote makes me worried about changing things too frequently.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Mio,,"But if we stay fixed, do we risk those long interruptions when someone's role changes?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"A ""free"" system sounds like a nightmare for ergonomics. I can't spend every morning adjusting my monitor.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, that is a good point. But the social benefit of sitting together is so precious for the team.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We must avoid a system that creates an unfair advantage based on arrival time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with Shizue. Stability seems better for the budget.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Mio,,I just don't want to waste my morning plugging in cables for ten minutes!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. The sound levels and the physio's notes suggest we need stability for our health and focus.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"It sounds like we all value some form of stability, though for different reasons.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Toshio,,We need a balance between fairness and efficiency.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I prefer something that doesn't cost us more money.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'm starting to think a totally free system is too chaotic.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Rationality dictates we avoid the ""Free Address"" option entirely.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
