55,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I feel that Fixed Desks by Function would keep us connected and stable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Rotating Blocks would solve the daylight fairness issue and the arrival time bias.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I think Fixed Desks are safest for the budget.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Rotating Blocks sounds like a fun compromise, but is it too much work?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Fixed Desks are the only way to ensure the workstation settings and noise levels are managed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, would rotating blocks still allow the new joiners to overhear and learn?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Yes, as long as the blocks are functional. But it ensures no one is stuck in the noisy corner forever.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,But wouldn't rotating mean paying the facilities quote again and again?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Mio,,@Daisuke is right. That sounds expensive and time-consuming.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,Rotating is just a slower version of the chaos Mio dislikes. Fixed is the only logical choice.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let's prioritize the team's harmony and the new members' growth.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"If the cost is truly a barrier, I can concede to Fixed Desks, provided we assign them fairly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I would feel much better with Fixed Desks.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Mio,,"If everyone else is on board, I'll go with Fixed Desks too!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Finally, a sensible conclusion.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Then we are all in agreement.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
